  "topography": {
    "project_purpose": "SparkleX is a yield protocol that automates liquidity provision and management on Uniswap V3. It allows users to deposit tokens into vaults that execute strategies for adding, rebalancing, and removing liquidity to optimize returns.",
    "relationship_narrative": "The Manager contract orchestrates the vault lifecycle, while UserVaultFactory deploys individual UserVault instances for each user. The Uniswap V3 operation contracts (Mint, AddLiquidity, DecreaseLiquidity, etc.) are called by the vaults to execute specific liquidity actions, sharing the same proxy-based upgradeable infrastructure.",
